.TH MSGSND 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
msgsnd \- send a System V message
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/msg.h>
.B int msgsnd(int id, const void* message, size_t size, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Message begins with a positive long message type followed by size bytes of
text.  IPC_NOWAIT makes a full queue fail instead of blocking.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR msgrcv (3crunch),
.BR msgget (3crunch),
.BR msgsnd (2)
